    "<span class=\"note\">SSL certificate type: <i>My development endpoint is a sub-domain of a domain that has a wildcard certificate from a certificate authority</i>, since Cloudflare's edge certificate is *.domain. " +
    "With the trusted-CA option Alexa never calls the app (SKILL_ENDPOINT_ERROR in the Device Log).</span></li>" +
    "<li><b>Interaction Model → JSON Editor</b>: paste " + chip(null, "skill-package/interactionModels/custom/<locale>.json") +
    " then <b>Save</b> and <b>Build skill</b>." +
